- **Description**: Calculate the total size of all the imaging files within a series in megabytes. This involves summing the sizes of individual image instances initially provided in bytes, converting this total into megabytes by dividing by 1,000,000, and rounding the result to two decimal places. This metric is crucial for understanding the data volume associated with the seri...
